      "CEO Perspective: John Turner, Chairman, President and CEO of Regions Financial Corp.",
      "\"At Regions Bank, we're seeing the benefits of the investments we're making in talent, technology and strategic growth. By remaining disciplined in our approach to risk management and staying committed to soundness, profitability, and growth, we are delivering strong results built on solid fundamentals and a competitive strategy. Strong credit quality, continued momentum in fee-based businesses, and economically vibrant markets throughout our footprint all contributed to our third quarter results. As we continue to modernize the franchise and expand our capabilities, Regions Bank is well positioned to meet the evolving needs of our customers and drive more sustainable growth over time.\""
